# Your Unmap browser key, from https://unmap.dev/dashboard, with the Urban Noise add-on.
# Without the add-on the app shows the basemap and says what the key is missing.
# On the dev plan the add-on works from localhost only.
# The key ships in the browser bundle: restrict it to your origins (e.g. http://localhost:3204 and
# your production domain) in the dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_UNMAP_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to https://api.unmap.dev.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_UNMAP_GATEWAY=https://api.unmap.dev

# Optional. The path the app is served under, e.g. /quiet-streets. Empty for a site of its own.
# BASE_PATH=
